id: recruit
name: Recruit
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Persuasion
requiresSkill: persuasion
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 1 Day
# The Minion Creation Rules are not in this system: what it does is said on the card.
effectNote: creates a Minion - its Race decided by the ARC
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A day convincing someone to follow you: a Minion, of a Race the ARC decides.
text: >
  Recruit: You convince someone to join your ranks, following you on your adventures.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Persuasion
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 1 Day
  –Effect: Create a Minion. That Minion’s Race is decided by the ARC.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Persuasion. Once the day is spent the card says
# a Minion is made, its Race the ARC's: the Minion Creation Rules are not built, so making it is the
# table's.
